This Purified Blade is beautiful. I feel a soothingly terrible energy coming from it. It is pleasant and, at the same time, leaves a feeling of fear.

I am very happy to be helping in some way.
I just need to melt this beautiful metal to make the Magic Censer. But I need a little more time at the forge.

Be careful; the Goblins seem to be attacking us.

Please, come back in a while.
